                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Birkenhead Iron Works,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Birkenhead,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 28, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir:</hi> In reply to your note of this day,
                    asking for Mr. Bravay’s address, it is as follows: Messrs. A. Bravay &amp; Co.,
                    6 Rue de Londres, Paris.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LAIRD BROTHERS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
